Package: yt-tui
Version: 1.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ticktessly <246650556+ticktessly@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python, ffmpeg, git, yt-dlp | yt-dlp-git
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Twilight0/yt-tui
Description: Curses TUI for yt-dlp with search and queueing
 Single-file Python curses interface for downloading video/audio
 with yt-dlp: YouTube search (videos + playlists), format picker,
 queue progress, history and mpv-style playback via termux-open.
